        <mxCell id="mount-step1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;align=left;fontColor=#2D7600;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=3;" value="1. Browser loads embed JS&lt;br&gt;2. querySelectorAll(&amp;lsquo;embed-counter&amp;rsquo;)&lt;br&gt;3. For each match: create app instance&lt;br&gt;4. Mount React/Vue/Svelte into tag&lt;br&gt;5. Inject scoped styles&lt;br&gt;6. Running independently" vertex="1">
