        <mxCell id="java-flow" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;align=left;fontColor=#333;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;Build:&lt;/b&gt; ./gradlew build&lt;br&gt;&amp;rarr; Gradle orchestrates npm install + build per embed&lt;br&gt;&amp;rarr; Copies bundles to static/embeds/&lt;br&gt;&amp;rarr; Spring Boot serves them&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Features:&lt;/b&gt; CORS config, Security config, single JAR" vertex="1">
