        <mxCell id="node-flow" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;align=left;fontColor=#333;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;Build:&lt;/b&gt; npm run build&lt;br&gt;&amp;rarr; npm workspaces build all embeds&lt;br&gt;&amp;rarr; copy-embeds.js copies to public/embeds/&lt;br&gt;&amp;rarr; Express serves them&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Features:&lt;/b&gt; ~1s startup, ~50 MB memory, lightweight" vertex="1">
